window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-60fa4628ebb92b18"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"sign-in-with-chatgpt\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"chatgpt\">使用 ChatGPT 登录</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在页面 URL 后追加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取文档的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>“使用 ChatGPT 登录”可让你使用 ChatGPT 账户登录参与此功能的应用和网站。在受支持的应用中，符合条件的 ChatGPT Plus 和 Pro 订阅用户还可以选择使用自己套餐中的用量来发起 AI 请求。</p> <p>登录和使用套餐是两项独立权限。连接之前，你可以查看应用能够访问哪些内容。</p> <p><a id=\"partners\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">合作伙伴</h2> <p>可使用 ChatGPT 套餐用量的应用：</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://ampcode.com/auth/sign-in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Amp Code（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.conductor.build/users/log_in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Conductor（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://dactyl.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dactyl（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.devin.ai/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Devin（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://portal.nousresearch.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hermes Agent（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://hyperagent.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hyperagent（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.kilo.ai/users/sign_in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kilo Code（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://lovable.dev/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lovable（即将推出）（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.notion.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Notion（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://vercel.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vercel（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://us1.vorflux.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vorflux（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.warp.dev/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Warp（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <p>仅提供登录的应用： 这些应用可让你使用 ChatGPT 登录，但不会使用你 ChatGPT 套餐中的用量。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://airtable.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Airtable（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/login/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Canva（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://gitlab.com/users/sign_in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitLab（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.hubspot.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">HubSpot（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://supabase.com/dashboard/sign-in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Supabase（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <p>开源集成：</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenClaw（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenCode（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://github.com/earendil-works/pi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pi（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">T3（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <p><a id=\"sign-in-with-chatgpt_1\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"chatgpt_1\">使用 ChatGPT 登录</h2> <ol> <li>在参与此功能的应用或网站中，选择 <strong>Continue with ChatGPT（继续使用 ChatGPT）</strong>。</li> <li>登录你想使用的 ChatGPT 账户。</li> <li>检查应用申请访问的账户信息，例如姓名、电子邮件地址和个人头像。</li> <li>继续完成登录。如果你已使用相同电子邮件地址注册该应用账户，请按照应用提示确认并关联账户。</li> </ol> <p>你也可以在参与此功能的应用中，将 ChatGPT 关联到已有账户。先登录该应用，再到账户或账单设置中查找 ChatGPT 选项。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：某个应用中的“连接你的 ChatGPT 套餐”面板，其中有“继续使用 ChatGPT”按钮。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"use-your-chatgpt-plan\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"chatgpt_2\">使用你的 ChatGPT 套餐</h2> <p>部分应用还允许你使用 ChatGPT 套餐处理符合条件的 AI 请求。这会使用你的套餐中包含的 Codex / ChatGPT Work 用量。</p> <p>当应用请求使用你的套餐时，请查看 <strong>Use your ChatGPT plan（使用你的 ChatGPT 套餐）</strong> 权限，并决定是否允许。选择 <strong>Continue（继续）</strong> 即可继续操作。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：ChatGPT 的应用授权界面，“使用你的 ChatGPT 套餐”权限处于启用状态，并显示“继续”和“取消”控件，以及可在 ChatGPT 设置中管理此连接的提示。</p> </blockquote> <p>应用使用量会计入你现有套餐的限额。连接应用不会增加新的用量额度，而且该应用可能另行收费。</p> <p>使用你的套餐不会让应用访问你的 ChatGPT 对话或记忆。请分别检查应用申请的其他权限。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：某个应用的模型菜单中显示“正在使用 ChatGPT 套餐”和“管理用量”按钮。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"see-and-manage-usage\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">查看和管理用量</h2> <p>在 ChatGPT 中，打开 <strong>Settings（设置）&gt; Usage（用量）</strong>，即可查看已连接的应用如何使用你的套餐。</p> <p>为某个应用设置限额：</p> <ol> <li>在 <strong>App limits（应用限额）</strong> 下，打开该应用旁边的百分比菜单。</li> <li>将每周限额设为你的套餐每周总用量的某个百分比。</li> <li>选择 <strong>Save（保存）</strong>。</li> </ol> <p>应用限额是上限，并非单独的额度，也不是为该应用预留的一部分套餐用量。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：ChatGPT 的“应用限额”设置中，为 Pate Perfect 显示百分比菜单和“保存”按钮。</p> </blockquote> <p>要彻底断开外部合作伙伴工具的访问权限，请前往 <strong>ChatGPT Settings（ChatGPT 设置）&gt; Security and login（安全与登录）&gt; Sign in with ChatGPT（使用 ChatGPT 登录）</strong>，选择相应应用，然后选择 <strong>Disconnect（断开连接）</strong>。</p> <p>如需“使用 ChatGPT 登录”方面的帮助，请访问 <a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001542\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI 帮助中心（需联网）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"for-developers\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">面向开发者</h2> <p>要在你的应用中加入“使用 ChatGPT 登录”，请先阅读<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/siwc.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">使用 ChatGPT 登录开发者文档</a>。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"sign-in-with-chatgpt\">Sign in with ChatGPT</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Sign in with ChatGPT lets you sign in to participating apps and sites with your ChatGPT account. In supported apps, eligible ChatGPT Plus and Pro subscribers can also choose to use their ChatGPT plan for AI requests.</p> <p>Signing in and using your plan are separate permissions. You review what an app can access before you connect it.</p> <h2 id=\"partners\">Partners</h2> <p>Apps with ChatGPT plan usage:</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://ampcode.com/auth/sign-in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Amp Code (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.conductor.build/users/log_in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Conductor (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://dactyl.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dactyl (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.devin.ai/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Devin (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://portal.nousresearch.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hermes Agent (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://hyperagent.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hyperagent (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.kilo.ai/users/sign_in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kilo Code (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://lovable.dev/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lovable (coming soon) (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.notion.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Notion (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://vercel.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vercel (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://us1.vorflux.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vorflux (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.warp.dev/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Warp (online)</a></li> </ul> <p>Apps with sign-in only: These apps let you sign in with ChatGPT without using your ChatGPT plan.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://airtable.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Airtable (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/login/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Canva (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://gitlab.com/users/sign_in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitLab (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://app.hubspot.com/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">HubSpot (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://supabase.com/dashboard/sign-in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Supabase (online)</a></li> </ul> <p>Open-source integrations:</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenClaw (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenCode (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://github.com/earendil-works/pi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pi (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">T3 (online)</a></li> </ul> <h2 id=\"sign-in-with-chatgpt_1\">Sign in with ChatGPT</h2> <ol> <li>In a participating app or site, select <strong>Continue with ChatGPT</strong>.</li> <li>Sign in to the ChatGPT account you want to use.</li> <li>Review the account information the app is requesting, such as your name, email address, and profile picture.</li> <li>Continue to finish signing in. If you already have an account with the app using the same email address, follow the app's prompts to confirm and link the accounts.</li> </ol> <p>You can also link ChatGPT to an existing account in a participating app. Sign in to the app, then look for the ChatGPT option in its account or billing settings.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: An app's Connect your ChatGPT plan panel with a Continue with ChatGPT button.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"use-your-chatgpt-plan\">Use your ChatGPT plan</h2> <p>Some apps also let you use your ChatGPT plan for eligible AI requests. It uses your Codex / ChatGPT work usage included in your plan.</p> <p>When an app asks to use your plan, review the <strong>Use your ChatGPT plan</strong> permission and choose whether to allow it. Select <strong>Continue</strong> to proceed.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: ChatGPT consent screen for an app, with Use your ChatGPT plan enabled, Continue and Cancel controls, and a reminder that the connection can be managed in ChatGPT settings.</p> </blockquote> <p>App usage counts toward your existing plan limits. Connecting an app does not add a new allowance, and the app may have its own fees.</p> <p>Using your plan does not give the app access to your ChatGPT conversations or memories. Review any other permissions the app requests separately.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: An app's model menu showing Using ChatGPT plan and a Manage usage button.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"see-and-manage-usage\">See and manage usage</h2> <p>In ChatGPT, open <strong>Settings &gt; Usage</strong> to see how connected apps use your plan.</p> <p>To set a limit for an app:</p> <ol> <li>Under <strong>App limits</strong>, open the percentage menu next to the app.</li> <li>Set its weekly limit as a percentage of your overall weekly plan usage.</li> <li>Select <strong>Save</strong>.</li> </ol> <p>An app's limit is a cap, not a separate allowance or a reserved portion of your plan.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: ChatGPT App limits settings with a percentage menu for Pate Perfect and a Save button.</p> </blockquote> <p>To completely disconnect access for an external partner tool, go to <strong>ChatGPT Settings &gt; Security and login &gt; Sign in with ChatGPT</strong>, select the app, and select <strong>Disconnect</strong>.</p> <p>For help with Sign in with ChatGPT, visit the <a href=\"https://help.openai.com/en/articles/20001542\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Help Center (online)</a>.</p> <h2 id=\"for-developers\">For developers</h2> <p>To add Sign in with ChatGPT to your app, start with the <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/siwc.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sign in with ChatGPT developer documentation</a>.</p>"};
